    "vocabulary": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "South Pacific"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Broadway musical",
            "zh": "百老汇音乐剧"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the 1950s. It produced many popular songs. One of them was “Happy Talk”. It goes, “Happy talk, keep talking happy talk. Talk about things you like to do. You gotta have a dream. If you don’t have a dream, how can you have a dream come true?”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, as a middle school student, you are beginning to think "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about what your life will be like in the future. Alongside these “dreams” come many "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": Where do I want to live and work? What "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "career path",
            "zh": "职业道路"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for me? And, as you dream about the future, you need to start thinking about "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to make those dreams “come true”. Without a plan, your dreams will just be fantasies."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some of you may already have definite "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about your future, but many of you may not. You may have so many dreams that it’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to choose which one to follow. If you’re one of those people, a good way to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "narrow down",
            "zh": "缩减"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " those choices and get a clearer picture of your future is to take a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " look at your strengths and weaknesses. Ask yourself: What am I most interested in? What am I best at?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", if you like working with computers, a career in computer science might be worth considering. If you like being outdoors with "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", you might want to become a zoologist. Whatever likes or special talents you have—yes, we all have special talents—you should try to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them. You may benefit from talking to people with similar interests and talents, or those with careers that "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The funny thing about dreams, though, is that as you get older, your dreams may "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I never dreamt of becoming a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Like most kids my age, I wanted to be a rock star. But I always enjoyed reading, learning, and talking to people. These "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made teaching an ideal career choice for me."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The future is a funny place—it doesn’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " yet! But by having a (realistic) dream and staying positive, you are well on your way to making your dream “come true”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
